Description: Tasks, daily planner, and clock (GTK4 / libadwaita)
 Todo is a clean desktop task list with a Structured-inspired daily planner
 and a clock page (countdown timer and stopwatch). Features include search,
 filters, archive of completed tasks, and session inhibit while a timer runs.
 Data is stored under XDG user data directories and follows the system theme.
